   "where": "cell 1 (markdown)",
   "quote": "To *optimize* cost, we need to ensure we're *measuring* cost at every turn. Anthropic's API carries a `usage` block with input, output, and cache token counts. Below we define `usage_cost()` to turn those raw counts into dollar amounts using the [current per-million-token prices](https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/about-claude/pricing). Note that the `PRICING` table and cache multipliers below are a hardcoded snapshot of list prices at the time of writing, and per-token rates are subject to change as new models ship or introductory pricing expires."
  },
